" openmv``\\ ) gebruikt om verbinding te maken, het script op de camera te "
"pushen en elk frame op te halen::"

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:102
msgid ""
"Replace ``/dev/ttyACM0`` with the camera's serial port (e.g. ``COM3`` on "
"Windows). The ``openmv.camera.Camera`` constructor accepts the same protocol"
" parameters as `init` (``crc`` / ``seq`` / ``ack`` / ``events`` / "
"``max_payload`` / ``max_retry`` / ``timeout``) when the camera-side stack "
"has been reconfigured to match."
msgstr ""
"Vervang ``/dev/ttyACM0`` door de seriële poort van de camera (bijv. ``COM3``"
" op Windows). De ``openmv.camera.Camera`` constructor accepteert dezelfde "
"protocolparameters als `init` (\\ ``crc`` / ``seq`` / ``ack`` / ``events`` /"
" ``max_payload`` / ``max_retry`` / ``timeout``\\ ) wanneer de stack aan de "
"camerazijde overeenkomstig is geherconfigureerd."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:109
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Functies"

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:113
msgid ""
"Initialize (or reconfigure) the protocol stack and register the default "
"logical data channels (``stdin``, ``stdout``, ``stream`` and, if compiled "
"in, ``profile``). Raises ``RuntimeError`` if initialization fails. The "
"firmware boots with a default USB protocol stack already running, so calling"
" this is needed only to change the transport or override the default framing"
" parameters."
msgstr ""
"Initialiseert (of herconfigureert) de protocolstack en registreert de "
"standaard logische datakanalen (\\ ``stdin``\\ , ``stdout``\\ , ``stream`` "
"en, indien meegecompileerd, ``profile``\\ ). Genereert een ``RuntimeError`` "
"als de initialisatie mislukt. De firmware start op met een standaard USB-"
"protocolstack die al draait, dus het aanroepen hiervan is alleen nodig om "
"het transport te wijzigen of de standaard framingparameters te "
"overschrijven."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:120
msgid "``crc`` enables CRC validation on protocol frames."
msgstr "``crc`` schakelt CRC-validatie van protocolframes in."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:122
msgid "``seq`` enables sequence number tracking."
msgstr "``seq`` schakelt het bijhouden van volgnummers in."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:124
msgid "``ack`` enables per-frame acknowledgements."
msgstr "``ack`` schakelt bevestigingen per frame in."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:126
msgid "``events`` enables channel event notifications."
msgstr "``events`` schakelt kanaalgebeurtenis-notificaties in."

#: ../../library/omv.protocol.rst:128
msgid ""
"``max_payload`` is the maximum payload size in bytes. If omitted the per-"
"camera default below is used; it is derived from each board's protocol "
"buffer size as ``buffer - 10 (header) - 4 (CRC)``."
msgstr ""
"``max_payload`` is de maximale payloadgrootte in bytes. Indien weggelaten "
"wordt de onderstaande standaardwaarde per camera gebruikt; deze is afgeleid "
"van de protocolbuffergrootte van elk board als ``buffer - 10 (header) - 4 "
"(CRC)``\\ ."

